%% UI control to event sequence for mutating controls (ACK-or-refuse before UI mutation)
%% Source: UI-WIRING-GUIDE sections 1-2 (S04/S05/S14), UI-COMMANDS-v1 sections 2-3-6
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as UI_control_S04_S05
    participant CL as API_client
    participant WS as axum_ws
    participant SVC as Route_service
    participant GR as Graph_authority
    participant DB as SQLite_ledger
    participant EVB as Event_fanout
    participant TOAST as Refusal_toast_S14

    U->>UI: click Spawn sub-hive S04
    UI->>UI: disable and pending state with correlation_id
    UI->>CL: SPAWN_SUB_HIVE parent_task_id role correlation_id
    CL->>WS: COMMAND frame schema hiverouter.v1
    WS->>SVC: validate schema plus Origin and token
    SVC->>GR: check depth lt 3 and fanout lt 8
    alt allowed
        GR-->>SVC: ok no graph mutation yet
        SVC->>DB: INSERT task row and ledger row in transaction
        SVC-->>WS: ACK and NODE_SPAWN
        WS-->>CL: ACK and NODE_SPAWN
        CL-->>UI: render-back only after ACK no optimistic success
    else over cap
        GR-->>SVC: depth or fanout exceeded
        SVC-->>WS: ERROR E_FANOUT_LIMIT how_to_fix retryable
        WS-->>CL: ERROR
        CL-->>TOAST: refusal by name code plus how_to_fix
        TOAST-->>UI: stays un-mutated pending state cleared
    end
    Note over U,TOAST: Re-route S05 adds E_CYCLE for cycles, E_RESYNC_REQUIRED for stale expected_rev, E_REWIRE_IN_FLIGHT for streaming workers. All refusals carry code message how_to_fix and are logged plus ledgered.
    U->>UI: click Re-route S05 with stale expected_rev
    UI->>WS: REWIRE_TASK task_id new_parent_id expected_rev correlation_id
    WS->>SVC: validate rev against authoritative graph version
    SVC-->>WS: ERROR E_RESYNC_REQUIRED
    WS-->>UI: server snapshot resync and re-render current graph
